<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:ext="clr-namespace:;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns:rig="clr-namespace:UclOpenCoenDomeNavigation;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns:task="clr-namespace:UclOpenCoenDomeNavigationTask;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns:core="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Core;assembly=OpenRigs.Core"
                 xmlns:zap="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices.Zapit;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:orcl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Control;assembly=OpenRigs.Control"
                 xmlns:hd="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.HarpDevices;assembly=OpenRigs.HarpDevices"
                 xmlns:mf="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Manifest;assembly=OpenRigs.Manifest"
                 xmlns:lv="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.LiveView;assembly=OpenRigs.LiveView"
                 xmlns:orl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Logging;assembly=OpenRigs.Logging"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib"
                 xmlns:scr="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions;assembly=Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions"
                 xmlns:harp="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Harp;assembly=Bonsai.Harp"
                 xmlns:gl="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Shaders;assembly=Bonsai.Shaders"
                 xmlns:al="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Audio;assembly=Bonsai.Audio"
                 xmlns:dsp="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Dsp;assembly=Bonsai.Dsp"
                 xmlns:mix="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Mixer;assembly=Bonsai.Mixer"
                 xmlns:cvn="clr-namespace:OpenCV.Net;assembly=OpenCV.Net"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="DisplayDevice" Description="The display the dome projector is on (DomeDisplay); a launch property." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>RigSetup</Name>
        <Description>Reads this machine's rig.yml (ReadRigConfig) into the dome rig model (open_rigs.rigs.dome), opens every device with DomeHardware, starts the cameras 2 s later and opens the dome's display (DomeDisplay).</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
              <Name>ReadRigConfig</Name>
              <Description>Resolves this machine's rig configuration directory (ConfigRoot\MachineName), publishes it as RigConfigDirectory, and reads rig.yml from it. Fails at startup if either is missing.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:ResolveRigConfigDirectory">
                      <core:ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</core:ConfigRoot>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigDirectory</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Core:ReadRigConfig.bonsai">
                    <FileName>rig.yml</FileName>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rig:DeserializeFromYaml">
              <rig:Type xsi:type="TypeMapping" TypeArguments="rig:DomeRig" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>SpoutStepSize</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="SpoutStepSize" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:DomeHardware.bonsai">
              <Description>Every dome device, named as in the data, behind its subjects (Dome Building Blocks): the Behavior board (wheel distance, pulses, the ZapitTrigger line cleared however the workflow stops), the timestamp generator (Timestamp, HarpClockSet), both Lickety Splits, the three cameras and the lick spout stage, which homes, goes in and handles the spout commands.</Description>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                <Value>true</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Delay">
                <rx:DueTime>PT2S</rx:DueTime>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>StartCameras</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>ProjectionCalibration</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="DisplayDevice" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Vision:DomeDisplay.bonsai">
              <Description>The dome's BonVision window, mesh mapping and gamma correction from rig.yml's projectionCalibration; stimuli draw on DrawStimuli.</Description>
              <DisplayDevice>First</DisplayDevice>
              <WindowState>Fullscreen</WindowState>
              <Width>1920</Width>
              <Height>1080</Height>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source2" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="SubjectId" Description="The mouse's lab ID; the launch's own, from rig-control." />
        <Property Name="SessionId" Description="The session number; the launch's own, from rig-control." />
        <Property Name="TaskPath" Description="The task file read at Go: rig-control's copy of the one chosen at launch, with the form's edits; from the editor, config\task-abstract-av-corridor.yml." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Initialization</Name>
        <Description>The experiment controller (OpenRigs.Control, ExperimentControl): SubjectId and SessionId from the launch, ManualRewardUl and SpoutStepSize settable live (each a subject of its name, its one default there, shown to the controller by ParameterDefault a second after Start), the spout commands (handled by HarpLickSpoutStage in DomeHardware) at any time; at Go RunSettings (subject, session), TaskFilePath (TaskPath, the task file rig-control wrote) and TrainingStage are published.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Value" DisplayName="SubjectId" Description="The subject (mouse) lab ID." />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value></Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>SubjectId</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="SessionId" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>SubjectId</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="SubjectId" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Control:ExperimentControl.bonsai">
              <SubjectId>UNMAPPED</SubjectId>
              <SessionId />
              <ControlEndpoint>@tcp://127.0.0.1:5561</ControlEndpoint>
              <Parameters>
                <Parameter>
                  <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
                  <Value>0</Value>
                  <Description>Row of the task file's trainingStages to run, 0 to 5 (Tom Childs' stages 1 to 6; a row past the end stops the workflow at Go): suggested from the mouse's earlier experiments of the modality.</Description>
                  <Minimum>0</Minimum>
                  <Maximum>5</Maximum>
                  <WholeNumber>true</WholeNumber>
                </Parameter>
                <Parameter>
                  <Name>ManualRewardUl</Name>
                  <Value />
                  <Description>Microlitres RewardLeft and RewardRight deliver, taken live before Go and kept after it; until set, the ManualRewardUl subject's default (Initialization). The task's own rewards are this stage's rewardSizeUl (trainingStages).</Description>
                  <Minimum>0</Minimum>
                  <Maximum>20</Maximum>
                </Parameter>
                <Parameter>
                  <Name>SpoutStepSize</Name>
                  <Value />
                  <Description>Motor steps each spout nudge command moves, taken live while ready; until set, the SpoutStepSize subject's default (Initialization).</Description>
                  <Minimum>1</Minimum>
                  <WholeNumber>true</WholeNumber>
                </Parameter>
              </Parameters>
              <Commands>
                <Command>
                  <Name>RewardLeft</Name>
                  <Description>Deliver one reward on the left spout (flush).</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>RewardRight</Name>
                  <Description>Deliver one reward on the right spout (flush).</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>SpoutsHome</Name>
                  <Description>Move both spouts to the home position.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>SpoutsIn</Name>
                  <Description>Move both spouts to the in position.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>SpoutsOut</Name>
                  <Description>Move both spouts to the out position.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>SaveSpoutPositions</Name>
                  <Description>Save the spouts' in positions to this mouse's file.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>LeftUp</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the left spout up by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>LeftDown</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the left spout down by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>RightUp</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the right spout up by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>RightDown</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the right spout down by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>LeftFront</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the left spout forward by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>LeftBack</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the left spout back by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>RightFront</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the right spout forward by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>RightBack</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the right spout back by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>BaseLeft</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the spout base left by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
                <Command>
                  <Name>BaseRight</Name>
                  <Description>Nudge the spout base right by SpoutStepSize.</Description>
                </Command>
              </Commands>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>SubjectId</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:SubscribeWhen" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>SubjectId</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>SessionId</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>RunSettingsValid</Name>
              <Description>Subject and session given.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Item1.Trim().Length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; Item2.Trim().Length &gt; 0</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:First" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>RunSettings</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value>..\config\task-abstract-av-corridor.yml</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>TaskFilePath</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Value" DisplayName="TaskPath" Description="The task file read at Go: rig-control's copy of the one chosen at launch, with the form's edits; from the editor, config\task-abstract-av-corridor.yml." />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ParameterValue">
                <orcl:Name>TrainingStage</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>Convert.ToInt32(it)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>trainingStage</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="IntProperty">
                <Value>150</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
              <Name>SpoutStepSize</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ControlEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:OnParameterSet">
                <orcl:Name>SpoutStepSize</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>StepSizeToInt</scr:Name>
              <scr:Expression>Convert.ToInt32(it)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>SpoutStepSize</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="DoubleProperty">
                <Value>3</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
              <Name>ManualRewardUl</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ControlEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:OnParameterSet">
                <orcl:Name>ManualRewardUl</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>Given?</Name>
              <Description>A blank set keeps the size as it was.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>it.Trim().Length &gt; 0</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>RewardToDouble</scr:Name>
              <scr:Expression>Convert.ToDouble(it)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>ManualRewardUl</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>SpoutStepSize</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:DelaySubscription">
                <rx:DueTime>PT1S</rx:DueTime>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ParameterDefault">
                <orcl:Name>SpoutStepSize</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ManualRewardUl</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:DelaySubscription">
                <rx:DueTime>PT1S</rx:DueTime>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ParameterDefault">
                <orcl:Name>ManualRewardUl</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="23" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="25" To="26" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="28" To="29" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="31" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="33" To="34" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="34" To="35" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="36" To="37" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="38" To="39" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="39" To="40" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="40" To="41" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="41" To="42" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="43" To="44" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="44" To="45" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="45" To="46" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="47" To="48" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="48" To="49" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="49" To="50" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Declarations</Name>
        <Description>Subjects several groups share: Zapit's commands and replies, reward requests (side, microlitres) for DeliverReward, the mixer's buffers, and the task's events and rows.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="zap:ZapitCommand">
              <rx:Name>ZapitCommands</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="zap:ZapitReply">
              <rx:Name>ZapitReplies</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Tuple(sys:String,sys:Double)">
              <rx:Name>RewardRequests</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="cvn:Mat">
              <rx:Name>Buffer</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="cvn:Mat">
              <rx:Name>RewardBuffer</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="cvn:Mat">
              <rx:Name>ErrorBuffer</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="ext:CorridorEvent">
              <rx:Name>TrialEvents</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="harp:Timestamped(ext:TrialRow)">
              <rx:Name>TrialRow</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="harp:Timestamped(ext:StimulusStateRow)">
              <rx:Name>StimulusRows</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges />
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Ready</Name>
        <Description>Reports Ready once the Harp clock is set and the spouts are homed (the two zipped). Beside it, StartupWatchdog stops the workflow, naming what never came, if that takes longer than 400 s (the stage homes each motor within 60 s); it completes without a value, so nothing reads its output.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>HarpClockSet</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value>HarpClockSet</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Homed</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value>SpoutsHomed</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="core:StartupWatchdog">
                <core:Expected>HarpClockSet, SpoutsHomed</core:Expected>
                <core:TimeoutSeconds>400</core:TimeoutSeconds>
                <core:What>Readying the rig (the Harp clock and the spout stage's homing)</core:What>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportPhase">
                <orcl:Phase>Ready</orcl:Phase>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="8" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Task</Name>
        <Description>Reads the task file at Go (TaskConfig) and checks it with the stage and rig.yml (CreateCorridorSetup: a stage past the table, a reward zone outside the sweep in src\waveforms\sweep.json, the optogenetics rules, the Zapit conditions file). A real mouse on a rig without hardware triggering is the Zapit group's refusal.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskFilePath</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rig:ReadTextFile" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="task:DeserializeFromYaml">
              <task:Type xsi:type="TypeMapping" TypeArguments="task:UclOpenCoenDomeNavigationTaskLogic" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CreateCorridorSetup">
                <ext:SweepFile>waveforms\sweep.json</ext:SweepFile>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>CorridorSetup</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="7" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Zapit</Name>
        <Description>Zapit, only in an optogenetics experiment: OpenRigs.Devices Zapit.ConnectZapit, given the task's conditions file, connects to rig.yml's Zapit, carries ZapitCommands and ZapitReplies, and stops the workflow on an error reply, no conditions file loaded, a conditions count other than the file's, or a real mouse on a rig without hardware triggering.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>OptogeneticsEnabled?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>TaskParameters.Optogenetics.UseZapit</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>TaskParameters.Optogenetics.ZapitConfigPath</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:Zapit.ConnectZapit.bonsai" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Commands</Name>
        <Description>RewardLeft and RewardRight give ManualRewardUl on that side (DeliverReward). The spout commands are DomeHardware's (HarpLickSpoutStage).</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ControlEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:OnCommand">
                <orcl:Name>RewardLeft</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value>left</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ManualRewardUl</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>RewardRequests</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:OnCommand">
                <orcl:Name>RewardRight</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value>right</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ManualRewardUl</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>RewardRequests</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="0" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source2" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Grating</Name>
        <Description>The grating (BonVision DrawGratings) on the dome: each pip sets its spatial frequency and opacity (TaskLogic); off between trials.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>DrawStimuli</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
              <rx:Name>GratingSpatialFrequency</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="SpatialFrequency" Selector="it" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
              <rx:Name>GratingOpacity</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="Opacity" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="BonVision:Primitives.DrawGratings.bonsai">
              <LocationX>0</LocationX>
              <LocationY>30</LocationY>
              <Layer>1</Layer>
              <ExtentX>270</ExtentX>
              <ExtentY>105</ExtentY>
              <SpatialFrequency>0.3</SpatialFrequency>
              <TemporalFrequency>0</TemporalFrequency>
              <Phase>16.8036766</Phase>
              <Angle>90</Angle>
              <SquareWave>false</SquareWave>
              <Contrast>1</Contrast>
              <DutyCycle xsi:nil="true" />
              <Radius>1000</Radius>
              <Aperture>0</Aperture>
              <Opacity>0</Opacity>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="5" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source3" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Audio</Name>
        <Description>The dome speakers (rig.yml speakerArray.device), started bootDelay (at least 3 s) after Start: one mixer source each for the pips (Buffer), the reward tone and the error tone, so they play over each other, and the background noise, looped from Start and faded in to the task's level at Go. Every file in src\waveforms is one channel, at the loudness it plays at. Every rig.yml speaker needs a filter or the workflow stops at Start naming it (RequireSpeakerFilters, the rule every dome holds).</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
              <Name>Mixer</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>MixerDevice</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="mix:CreateMixerContext">
                            <mix:HostApi>Windows WDM-KS</mix:HostApi>
                            <mix:DeviceName>Speakers (XMOS xCORE-200 MC (UAC2.0))</mix:DeviceName>
                            <mix:SampleRate>48000</mix:SampleRate>
                            <mix:ChannelCount xsi:nil="true" />
                            <mix:SuggestedLatency>0.002</mix:SuggestedLatency>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="mix:StartMixer" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
                          <Name>Mixer</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                          <PropertyMappings>
                            <Property Name="HostApi" Selector="SpeakerArray.Device.HostApi" />
                            <Property Name="DeviceName" Selector="SpeakerArray.Device.DeviceName" />
                            <Property Name="SampleRate" Selector="SpeakerArray.Device.SampleRate" />
                            <Property Name="SuggestedLatency" Selector="SpeakerArray.Device.SuggestedLatency" />
                          </PropertyMappings>
                        </Expression>
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="4" To="0" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Name>BootDelay</scr:Name>
                    <scr:Description>rig.yml's bootDelay, never under 3 s: a fault while the sound card boots can blue-screen the PC.</scr:Description>
                    <scr:Expression>TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Max(3.0, SpeakerArray.Device.BootDelay))</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueTime" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>MixerBootDelay</Name>
                    <Description>Deliberate: the mixer starts at least 3 s after Start. Never remove or shorten it.</Description>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:DelaySubscription">
                      <rx:DueTime>PT3S</rx:DueTime>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="0" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Buffer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Mixer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:CreateSource">
                <mix:Looping>false</mix:Looping>
                <mix:Playing>true</mix:Playing>
                <mix:Gain>1</mix:Gain>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:AppendBuffer" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RewardBuffer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Mixer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:CreateSource">
                <mix:Looping>false</mix:Looping>
                <mix:Playing>true</mix:Playing>
                <mix:Gain>1</mix:Gain>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:AppendBuffer" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ErrorBuffer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Mixer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:CreateSource">
                <mix:Looping>false</mix:Looping>
                <mix:Playing>true</mix:Playing>
                <mix:Gain>1</mix:Gain>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:AppendBuffer" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:MatrixReader">
                <dsp:Path>./waveforms/all_waveforms.bin</dsp:Path>
                <dsp:Offset>0</dsp:Offset>
                <dsp:SampleRate>48000</dsp:SampleRate>
                <dsp:ChannelCount>1</dsp:ChannelCount>
                <dsp:BufferLength>2400</dsp:BufferLength>
                <dsp:Depth>F32</dsp:Depth>
                <dsp:Layout>RowMajor</dsp:Layout>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:Tile">
                <dsp:RowTiles>32</dsp:RowTiles>
                <dsp:ColumnTiles>1</dsp:ColumnTiles>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:ToList" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>PipBuffers</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:MatrixReader">
                <dsp:Path>./waveforms/reward_tone.bin</dsp:Path>
                <dsp:Offset>0</dsp:Offset>
                <dsp:SampleRate>0</dsp:SampleRate>
                <dsp:ChannelCount>1</dsp:ChannelCount>
                <dsp:BufferLength>0</dsp:BufferLength>
                <dsp:Depth>F32</dsp:Depth>
                <dsp:Layout>RowMajor</dsp:Layout>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:Tile">
                <dsp:RowTiles>32</dsp:RowTiles>
                <dsp:ColumnTiles>1</dsp:ColumnTiles>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>RewardTone</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>TaskParameters.Punishment.Sound.Path</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="FileName" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="al:AudioReader">
                <al:FileName>waveforms\error_tone.wav</al:FileName>
                <al:BufferLength>0</al:BufferLength>
                <al:SampleRate>0</al:SampleRate>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>ErrorGain</scr:Name>
              <scr:Description>The file is 16-bit at the error tone's loudness; the task's punishment.sound.gain scales it.</scr:Description>
              <scr:Expression>it.TaskParameters.Punishment.Sound.Gain / 32767.0</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="Scale" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:ConvertScale">
                <dsp:Depth>F32</dsp:Depth>
                <dsp:Scale>3.051850947599719e-05</dsp:Scale>
                <dsp:Shift>0</dsp:Shift>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:Tile">
                <dsp:RowTiles>32</dsp:RowTiles>
                <dsp:ColumnTiles>1</dsp:ColumnTiles>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>ErrorTone</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Mixer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:CreateSource">
                <mix:Looping>true</mix:Looping>
                <mix:Playing>true</mix:Playing>
                <mix:Gain>0</mix:Gain>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
              <Name>BackgroundSource</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:MatrixReader">
                <dsp:Path>./waveforms/background_noise.bin</dsp:Path>
                <dsp:Offset>0</dsp:Offset>
                <dsp:SampleRate>0</dsp:SampleRate>
                <dsp:ChannelCount>1</dsp:ChannelCount>
                <dsp:BufferLength>0</dsp:BufferLength>
                <dsp:Depth>F32</dsp:Depth>
                <dsp:Layout>RowMajor</dsp:Layout>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>BackgroundSource</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:AppendBuffer" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>BackgroundNoiseGain</scr:Name>
              <scr:Description>The noise file has a pip's RMS, so the task's backgroundNoiseLevel is the gain.</scr:Description>
              <scr:Expression>Convert.ToSingle(it.TaskParameters.BackgroundNoiseLevel)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>BackgroundSource</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:CombineLatest" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="InputMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="Gain" Selector="Item1" />
              </PropertyMappings>
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="mix:SetGain">
                <mix:Gain>0</mix:Gain>
                <mix:Duration>2</mix:Duration>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>SpeakerArray</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:RequireSpeakerFilters" />
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="25" To="29" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="27" To="28" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="28" To="29" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="29" To="30" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="31" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="33" To="34" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="35" To="36" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="36" To="38" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="37" To="38" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="39" To="40" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="40" To="42" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="41" To="42" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="42" To="43" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="43" To="44" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="45" To="46" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="46" To="47" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>StartTrials</Name>
        <Description>Trials start 0.5 s after the experiment folder exists and the tones are loaded (TrialsReady).</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>CorridorSetup</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PipBuffers</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item1</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Delay">
                <rx:DueTime>PT0.5S</rx:DueTime>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>TrialsReady</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>TaskLogic</Name>
        <Description>The task in tested C# (src\Extensions\Corridor.cs, tests\Extensions.Tests): CorridorTask draws each trial (TrialDraw) at the start of its interval (the last outcome after any timeout), has a hardware-triggered Zapit armed during it (Arm, once the last trigger line has fallen), starts it at Go (Start, beep 0: the interval's end less the lead, max(laserToStimulusSeconds, 0), or later until the stage's quiet waits hold), then runs it along the virtual track (VirtualTrack) with a pip every 50 ms from the lead after Go, all on the Harp clock (Timestamp), until the outcome. Its events drive the hardware here: Arm sends Zapit the trial's condition (laser-off trials at 0 mW); Trigger, laserToStimulusSeconds before the first pip (after it if negative), raises the ZapitTrigger line (and on a software-triggered rig sends the StartStimulus) in an optogenetics experiment only, and CorridorTask stops the task if Zapit has not answered by then; Pip plays the pip and sets the grating; Outcome writes the trial row, rewards (DeliverReward, left spout) or plays the error tone, and in an optogenetics experiment clears the trigger line triggerHoldSeconds later (HarpDelay). Zapit adds no time.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialsReady</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WheelDistanceCm</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickStateLeft</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitReplies</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorTask" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                <ext:Kind>Arm</ext:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:ZapitTrialCommand">
                <ext:HardwareTriggered>true</ext:HardwareTriggered>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>ZapitCommands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                <ext:Kind>Start</ext:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Trial.trialNumber</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>trialNumber</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Trial.rewardSizeUl</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>rewardSizeUl</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Trial.laserCondition</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>laserCondition</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>Optogenetics?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Trial.optogenetics</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitTriggerLine</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="zap:ZapitLineMessage">
                <zap:Set>true</zap:Set>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>SoftwareTriggered?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Trial.optogenetics &amp;&amp; !Trial.armZapit</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:ZapitTrialCommand">
                <ext:HardwareTriggered>false</ext:HardwareTriggered>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>ZapitCommands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>LaserOnUntilOutcome</Name>
              <Description>From the trigger, stops Zapit once per optogenetics trial: at the outcome, at laserMaxSeconds on the Harp clock (LaserCap), or at laserMaxSeconds on the wall clock, a backstop should the board stall (the one wall-clock wait in TaskLogic). A trial that ends before its trigger has no laser; the next StartStimulus disarms it.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                      <ext:Kind>Outcome</ext:Kind>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                      <ext:Kind>LaserCap</ext:Kind>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Name>LaserMax</scr:Name>
                    <scr:Expression>TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Trial.laserMaxSeconds)</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueTime" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Timer">
                      <rx:DueTime>PT12.5S</rx:DueTime>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="ext:StopZapit" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>ZapitCommands</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Unit" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Unit" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Unit" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="14" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="15" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="13" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="15" To="8" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                <ext:Kind>Pip</ext:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PipBuffers</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:PipBuffer" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>Buffer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Frame.Row.visualSpatialFrequencyCpd</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>GratingSpatialFrequency</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Frame.GratingOpacity</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>GratingOpacity</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CreateStimulusRow" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>StimulusRows</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                <ext:Kind>Outcome</ext:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="DoubleProperty">
                <Value>0</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>GratingOpacity</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CreateTrialRow" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>TrialRow</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>Rewarded?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Rewarded</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Reward</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>RewardRequests</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RewardTone</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>RewardBuffer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>ErrorSound?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>ErrorSound</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ErrorTone</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>ErrorBuffer</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>OptogeneticsOutcome?</Name>
              <Description>Only an optogenetics experiment clears the trigger line, as only one raises it (Pip, 13 Nov 2026).</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Trial.optogenetics</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="InputMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="Trial.triggerHoldSeconds" />
              </PropertyMappings>
              <Selector>it</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                <core:DueSeconds>1</core:DueSeconds>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitTriggerLine</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="zap:ZapitLineMessage">
                <zap:Set>false</zap:Set>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                <ext:Kind>Trigger</ext:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="5" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="2" To="5" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="3" To="5" Label="Source4" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source5" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="69" To="19" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="21" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="69" To="25" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="25" To="26" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="28" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="29" To="30" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="32" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="31" To="32" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="33" To="34" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="35" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="35" To="36" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="37" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="37" To="38" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="39" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="39" To="40" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="41" To="42" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="43" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="43" To="44" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="45" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="45" To="46" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="47" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="47" To="48" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="48" To="49" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="47" To="51" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="50" To="51" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="51" To="52" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="52" To="53" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="54" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="54" To="56" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="55" To="56" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="56" To="57" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="57" To="58" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="59" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="59" To="60" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="60" To="62" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="61" To="62" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="62" To="64" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="63" To="64" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="64" To="65" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="65" To="66" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="66" To="67" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="68" To="69" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="MissingCalibration" Description="What a reward valve with no calibration file does: Refuse stops the workflow at Start; DeliverNothing (the test mouse) logs each reward as 0 ul. rig-control sets it per launch." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Logging</Name>
        <Description>Everything written to the experiment folder: LogControllerLogic makes the folder at Go and publishes PathPrefix; ExperimentLogs holds every log that waits for it; DomeHarpLogs records the Harp boards; DeliverReward delivers and logs rewards; BonsaiData_Async takes the controller's events; RecordHarpDevices, ExperimentManifest and the Recording phase follow PathPrefix.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
              <Name>LogControllerLogic</Name>
              <Description>Waits for Go (RunSettings: the controller's SubjectId and SessionId), then LogController creates the experiment folder RootPath\sub-&lt;SubjectId&gt;\ses-&lt;SessionId&gt;_&lt;DateTime&gt; and publishes it as PathPrefix, which every log waits for. RootPath is rig.yml's, the rig's acquisition folder itself (C:\Coen-Lab-Local\Acquired-Data): experiments have no project folder.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RunSettings</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="SubjectId" Selector="Item1" />
                      <Property Name="SessionId" Selector="Item2" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>RootPath</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Path" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogController.bonsai">
                    <SubjectId>UNMAPPED</SubjectId>
                    <SessionId>UNMAPPED</SessionId>
                    <Path>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\Acquired-Data</Path>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:DelaySubscription">
                      <rx:DueTime>PT1S</rx:DueTime>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RunSettings</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:SubscribeWhen" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogAsync.bonsai">
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>ExperimentLogs</Name>
              <Description>Starts every experiment log once LogControllerLogic publishes PathPrefix: BonsaiData_Trial (LogTrial; one row per trial, built by CreateTrialRow when the outcome is known; columns in schemas\trial-columns.yml), BonsaiData_StimulusState (one row per pip), the three cameras (LogVideo, after PathPrefix: an include cannot subscribe to the experiment folder early), the settings files (Settings_Rig, Settings_Task, Settings_Experiment, Settings_ZapitConditions in an optogenetics experiment), the RngSeed event and Zapit's replies.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialRow</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogTrial.bonsai">
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>StimulusRows</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogData.bonsai">
                    <LogName>BonsaiData_StimulusState</LogName>
                    <Selector />
                    <AutoFlush>true</AutoFlush>
                    <Extension>csv</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>Cameras</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
                          <Workflow>
                            <Nodes>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>Camera-Face.Data</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Skip">
                                  <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideo.bonsai">
                                <LogName>Camera-Face</LogName>
                                <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>Camera-Pupil.Data</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Skip">
                                  <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideo.bonsai">
                                <LogName>Camera-Pupil</LogName>
                                <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>Camera-Body.Data</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Skip">
                                  <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideo.bonsai">
                                <LogName>Camera-Body</LogName>
                                <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                                <PropertyMappings>
                                  <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Settings.CameraTriggerController.Trigger0Frequency" />
                                </PropertyMappings>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                                <PropertyMappings>
                                  <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Settings.CameraTriggerController.Trigger0Frequency" />
                                </PropertyMappings>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                                <PropertyMappings>
                                  <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Settings.CameraTriggerController.Trigger0Frequency" />
                                </PropertyMappings>
                              </Expression>
                            </Nodes>
                            <Edges>
                              <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="10" To="2" Label="Source2" />
                              <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="12" To="5" Label="Source2" />
                              <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="14" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                            </Edges>
                          </Workflow>
                        </Expression>
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rig:SerializeToJson">
                      <rig:Formatting>Indented</rig:Formatting>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_Rig</Name>
                    <Extension>json</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="task:SerializeToJson">
                      <task:Formatting>Indented</task:Formatting>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_Task</Name>
                    <Extension>json</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ExperimentSettings" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_Experiment</Name>
                    <Extension>json</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="ext:CorridorEvents">
                      <ext:Kind>Start</ext:Kind>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Name>RngSeed</Name>
                    <Description>The seed every draw of the experiment follows from (the task file's rngSeed, or one drawn at Go when it is null), logged once: the Take(1) is after the multicast, so the shared AsyncEvents subject never completes.</Description>
                    <Selector>Trial.rngSeed</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="orl:CreateAsyncEvent">
                      <orl:Event>RngSeed</orl:Event>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>AsyncEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                      <Name>ZapitReplies</Name>
                      <Description>Harp-timestamped log of every Zapit reply from when ExperimentLogs starts (the presented condition and laser state per StartStimulus). ZapitReplies is a PublishSubject, so a reply before then, such as the startup GetNumConditions, is not in it.</Description>
                      <Workflow>
                        <Nodes>
                          <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                            <Name>ZapitReplies</Name>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                            <scr:Expression>new(
                  CommandCode as command,
                  Value as value,
                  LaserOn as laserOn,
                  IsError as isError,
                  ServerDatenum as serverDatenum)</scr:Expression>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
                            <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogData.bonsai">
                            <LogName>BonsaiData_ZapitReplies</LogName>
                            <Selector />
                            <Extension>csv</Extension>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                        </Nodes>
                        <Edges>
                          <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                          <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                          <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                          <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                        </Edges>
                      </Workflow>
                    </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                    <Name>OptogeneticsExperiment?</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                          <Name>Source1</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                          <scr:Expression>TaskParameters.Optogenetics.UseZapit</scr:Expression>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>TaskParameters.Optogenetics.ZapitConfigPath</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="zap:ZapitConditionsSnapshot" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_ZapitConditions</Name>
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="25" To="26" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:DomeHarpLogs.bonsai">
              <Description>One LogHarpDevice per dome Harp device, from the experiment folder and the Harp clock being set.</Description>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RewardRequests</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigFile</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="RigFile" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="MissingCalibration" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:BehaviorBoard.DeliverReward.bonsai">
              <Description>Each reward (side, microlitres), planned from that side's valve calibration and fired on the Harp clock at the calibration's pulseGapMs; a RewardDelivered row in BonsaiData_Async and each calibrated valve's file as ValveCalibrationDO&lt;n&gt;.</Description>
              <RigFile>UNMAPPED</RigFile>
              <CalibrationDirectory />
              <MissingCalibration>Refuse</MissingCalibration>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>path</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportPhase">
                <orcl:Phase>Recording</orcl:Phase>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="hd:RecordHarpDevices">
              <Name>RecordHarpDevices</Name>
              <Description>Checks every Harp device in rig.yml at Start and records it into each experiment (OpenRigs.HarpDevices): the Behavior board, the timestamp generator, both stepper drivers and both Lickety Splits (each a rig.yml entry with a portName whose data the workflow publishes as &lt;Name&gt;.Data) must be on their portName with their usbSerial, or the workflow stops saying which board is where; 0.5 s after the experiment folder appears it asks each for a register dump on &lt;Name&gt;.Commands, which its log records; and it writes &lt;Name&gt;\&lt;Name&gt;_device.json and the register map &lt;Name&gt;\&lt;Name&gt;.yml, which ExperimentManifest expects (harp).</Description>
              <hd:ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</hd:ConfigRoot>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="mf:ExperimentManifest">
              <Name>ExperimentManifest</Name>
              <Description>Writes manifest.json into the experiment folder (OpenRigs.Manifest), as av-dome's: the machine, this repo's commit, who launched it and sent Go, rig.yml and the calibration files the workflow reads (MeshMap.csv, gammalut.bmp, this mouse's spout positions) by hash, what each BonsaiData_Trial column means (schemas\trial-columns.yml), and what the experiment must leave: a folder for each device in rig.yml, the Harp device records, the three settings files and BonsaiData (Trial, Async and StimulusState); DeliverReward copies each calibrated valve's file in as ValveCalibrationDO&lt;n&gt;.</Description>
              <mf:IngestScript>coen-dome-navigation</mf:IngestScript>
              <mf:ConfigFiles>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\rig.yml;C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\calibration\MeshMap.csv;C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\calibration\gammalut.bmp;C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\calibration\LickSpoutPositions\{SubjectId}.csv</mf:ConfigFiles>
              <mf:ExpectedFiles>auto;harp;Settings/Settings_Rig_;Settings/Settings_Task_;Settings/Settings_Experiment_;BonsaiData/</mf:ExpectedFiles>
              <mf:TrialColumns>schemas\trial-columns.yml</mf:TrialColumns>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ControlEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>new((it.Kind.ToString() == &quot;Command&quot; ? it.Name : it.Kind.ToString()) as Event, it.ToString() as Detail)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orl:CreateAsyncEvent">
                <orl:Event>Control</orl:Event>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>AsyncEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="lv:StreamDevices">
        <Name>LiveView</Name>
        <Description>Streams every device in this machine's rig.yml that the workflow publishes, over ZeroMQ, for the live view (OpenRigs.LiveView): data on TCP 5556, video on 5558, from Start, in ready mode too. The three cameras as Camera-Face/Pupil/Body.video, 5 JPEG frames a second at 320 x 240, and the Behavior board's encoder from BehaviorBoard-Main.Data, 10 a second; each rate and size can be changed in rig.yml under the device's liveView:. Also elapsed, seconds since the experiment folder appeared, and liveview, this workflow and its commit. Every message carries the rig and the session key, ready until the experiment folder exists. Last in the workflow, because it streams only subjects built before it. A port already in use stops the workflow at Start.</Description>
        <lv:ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</lv:ConfigRoot>
        <lv:DataPort>5556</lv:DataPort>
        <lv:VideoPort>5558</lv:VideoPort>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
